# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile: sources only, never local secrets or outputs.
.git
# At any depth: a checkout's apps/web/.env.local would otherwise reach `next build` in a hand build.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
test-results
playwright-report
.superpowers
deploy/local/data
